    website: "https://roninforge.org"
abstract: >-
  RoninForge BudgetClaw is a local spend monitor for Claude Code that tracks
  token cost per project and per git branch and stops a runaway agent before a
  budget cap is breached. It reads the session logs Claude Code already writes
  to disk and never touches API traffic. It ships as a single static Go binary,
  is MIT licensed, runs entirely on your machine, and requires no API keys.
